#: freedombox/modules/tor/forms.py:96
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"When enabled, your {box_name} will run a Tor relay and donate bandwidth to "
"the Tor network. Do this if you have more than 2 megabits/s of upload and "
"download bandwidth."
